172
00:10:36,930 --> 00:10:40,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't tell me you swam here?!</font>

173
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:43,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, I did. From a place called Yahhoy.</font>

174
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:45,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yahhoy?!</font>

175
00:10:45,130 --> 00:10:49,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's on the other side of the planet!</font>

176
00:10:49,640 --> 00:10:53,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What were you thinking?!</font>

177
00:11:05,370 --> 00:11:09,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, those three were really
awesome in the last tournament!</font>

178
00:11:09,340 --> 00:11:13,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're entering again? Oh, man...</font>

179
00:11:13,380 --> 00:11:17,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It looks like there's a lot more
people here than last time!</font>

180
00:11:17,020 --> 00:11:20,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I guess this uniform
really is the best for me!</font>

181
00:11:20,660 --> 00:11:25,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, do you think Goku got even
stronger over the past three years?</font>

182
00:11:25,060 --> 00:11:26,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good question.</font>

183
00:11:26,630 --> 00:11:30,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He doesn't look like he's changed much...</font>

184
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:35,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You better all make it
through the preliminaries!</font>

185
00:11:35,370 --> 00:11:37,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck!</font>

186
00:11:38,210 --> 00:11:42,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Listen! Unleash everything you've
learned in the past three years!</font>

187
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:43,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

188
00:11:43,170 --> 00:11:45,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The preliminary matches are about to begin.</font>

189
00:11:45,500 --> 00:11:49,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">All fighters are asked to
assemble at the fighting hall.</font>

190
00:11:55,620 --> 00:11:58,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? Where's Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i>?</font>

191
00:11:58,220 --> 00:12:01,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh? He was just with us...</font>

192
00:12:01,050 --> 00:12:02,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Forget about him.</font>

193
00:12:02,460 --> 00:12:04,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's probably using the bathroom again.</font>

194
00:12:11,900 --> 00:12:15,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, isn't that Jackie Chun?</font>

195
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:16,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, it is.</font>

196
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:19,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He won the last tournament.</font>

197
00:12:19,770 --> 00:12:21,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Old man!</font>

198
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:28,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, it's nice to see you again.</font>

199
00:12:28,180 --> 00:12:30,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I knew you'd come!</font>

200
00:12:30,080 --> 00:12:32,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Indeed, I did. To see you.</font>

201
00:12:32,190 --> 00:12:33,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Really?</font>

202
00:12:33,590 --> 00:12:36,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I hope I can beat you this time!</font>

203
00:12:36,620 --> 00:12:38,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It appears you've trained even more.</font>

204
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:40,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I look forward to seeing you in action.</font>

205
00:12:40,590 --> 00:12:45,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Yeah, right! You won't beat me!</i></font>

206
00:12:45,430 --> 00:12:49,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>I'll have you know I secretly trained too!</i></font>

207
00:12:49,600 --> 00:12:56,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you all for coming to this,
the 22nd Tenkaichi Budokai.</font>

208
00:12:56,780 --> 00:13:00,110
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As you know, the number of entrants
has increased in recent years,</font>

209
00:13:00,110 --> 00:13:04,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so tournaments will be held once
every three years from now on.</font>

210
00:13:04,280 --> 00:13:09,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There are no less than 182 entrants
in the preliminary matches.</font>

211
00:13:09,520 --> 00:13:12,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">From them, only eight will be chosen.</font>

212
00:13:12,290 --> 00:13:15,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">These will be truly grueling matches.</font>

213
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:46,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let us first decide who
will fight in which matches.</font>

214
00:13:46,620 --> 00:13:51,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Each participant is to draw
a number from the box.</font>

215
00:14:05,460 --> 00:14:10,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">62. Which puts me in
the 2nd half of Block 2.</font>

216
00:14:10,770 --> 00:14:13,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm in the last half of Block 1.</font>

217
00:14:13,770 --> 00:14:16,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please don't make me fight Goku...</font>

218
00:14:16,970 --> 00:14:22,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Whew! I'm in the first half of Block 1!</font>

219
00:14:22,650 --> 00:14:24,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How about you, old man?</font>

220
00:14:24,910 --> 00:14:26,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Me?</font>

221
00:14:26,320 --> 00:14:31,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm number 178, so I'm in Block 4.</font>

222
00:14:31,220 --> 00:14:35,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's great! We're all spread out!</font>

223
00:14:35,330 --> 00:14:38,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We will now hold the preliminary matches</font>

224
00:14:38,160 --> 00:14:43,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">to determine the eight participants
for the Tenkaichi Budokai.</font>

225
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:46,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please find your number on
the preliminary match-up board</font>

226
00:14:46,840 --> 00:14:50,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and gather near the appropriate ring.</font>

227
00:14:52,340 --> 00:14:54,640
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The rules are as follows...</font>

228
00:14:54,640 --> 00:14:58,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The fights are one-on-one,
and take place in these rings.</font>

229
00:14:58,650 --> 00:15:03,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You lose if you fall off,
pass out, or give up.</font>

230
00:15:03,350 --> 00:15:05,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The use of weapons is forbidden.</font>

231
00:15:05,760 --> 00:15:08,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There are no time limits anymore.</font>

232
00:15:08,390 --> 00:15:11,830
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You will fight until a
conclusion has been reached.</font>

233
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:16,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's do it, Kuririn! Don't lose now!</font>

234
00:15:16,330 --> 00:15:17,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You got it!</font>

235
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:24,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's begin the Block 1
preliminary matches.</font>

236
00:15:24,440 --> 00:15:28,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Fighters 1 and 2, please enter the ring!</font>

237
00:15:28,820 --> 00:15:31,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, I better be careful not
to lose right off the bat...</font>

238
00:15:31,950 --> 00:15:33,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck, Yamucha!</font>

239
00:15:51,600 --> 00:15:53,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">A little kid, huh?</font>

240
00:15:54,640 --> 00:15:57,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please begin!</font>

241
00:16:04,720 --> 00:16:06,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die!</font>

242
00:16:32,900 --> 00:16:36,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Number 1 has passed out! Number 2 wins!</font>

243
00:16:36,200 --> 00:16:40,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was great! You must've trained a lot!</font>

244
00:16:41,570 --> 00:16:43,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I guess...</font>

245
00:16:43,160 --> 00:16:45,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Check it out. It looks like Kuririn's up.</font>

246
00:16:45,790 --> 00:16:47,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's watch!</font>

247
00:16:51,380 --> 00:16:53,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Number 63!</font>

248
00:16:53,590 --> 00:16:57,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Is fighter number 63 here?</font>

249
00:17:05,760 --> 00:17:08,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's that?</font>

250
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:26,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's huge!</font>

251
00:17:38,210 --> 00:17:42,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, let's commence with the fight.</font>

252
00:17:42,720 --> 00:17:45,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Begin!</font>

253
00:17:45,050 --> 00:17:48,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can attack me any time you're ready!</font>

254
00:17:48,520 --> 00:17:52,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's a saucy little mouth
ya got there, Octopus Baby!</font>

255
00:17:54,030 --> 00:17:55,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Octopus Baby?!</font>

256
00:17:55,860 --> 00:18:00,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Time to go splat!</font>

257
00:18:15,890 --> 00:18:18,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's the decision?</font>

258
00:18:19,920 --> 00:18:22,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ring out for number 63!</font>

259
00:18:22,390 --> 00:18:25,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Number 62 wins!</font>

260
00:18:25,760 --> 00:18:27,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Peace!</font>

261
00:18:32,800 --> 00:18:34,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That was amazing!</font>

262
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:38,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're way better than
you were three years ago!</font>

263
00:18:38,340 --> 00:18:40,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! Great job!</font>

264
00:18:40,340 --> 00:18:44,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, it's still too early to be surprised.</font>

265
00:18:44,150 --> 00:18:47,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm just getting warmed up.</font>

266
00:18:52,960 --> 00:18:57,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Only a simpleton would boast
about something like that.</font>

267
00:18:59,630 --> 00:19:01,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

268
00:19:09,520 --> 00:19:12,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? Who are you?</font>

269
00:19:12,690 --> 00:19:15,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's a pupil of Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i>'s rival,</font>

270
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:18,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">the creepy old Crane Hermit.</font>

271
00:19:18,690 --> 00:19:23,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're lucky you don't have to
fight me in the preliminaries.</font>

272
00:19:23,260 --> 00:19:24,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What?!</font>

273
00:19:34,970 --> 00:19:38,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's with this guy?</font>

274
00:19:38,940 --> 00:19:41,040
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You sure are weird.</font>

275
00:19:47,420 --> 00:19:48,850
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shorty.</font>

276
00:19:49,950 --> 00:19:53,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What? Who're you to talk?!</font>

277
00:19:53,190 --> 00:19:54,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Shorty.</font>

278
00:19:54,490 --> 00:19:57,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Why, you little!</font>

279
00:20:00,030 --> 00:20:01,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's enough, Chaozu.</font>

280
00:20:01,470 --> 00:20:06,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We're going to destroy these
guys in the ring soon enough.</font>

281
00:20:06,940 --> 00:20:11,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Assuming they make it into
the final eight, of course.</font>

282
00:20:13,530 --> 00:20:17,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Get lost. Before I make you.</font>

283
00:20:17,140 --> 00:20:20,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Your spirit is praise-worthy,
but in your last fight,</font>

284
00:20:20,470 --> 00:20:24,210
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">you missed your opponent's
vital spot by one centimeter.</font>

285
00:20:24,210 --> 00:20:26,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I missed on purpose.</font>

286
00:20:26,010 --> 00:20:28,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't feel like becoming a murderer.</font>

287
00:20:28,710 --> 00:20:34,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But I don't hold back
when I fight guys like you.</font>

288
00:20:34,890 --> 00:20:36,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Interesting.</font>

289
00:20:36,990 --> 00:20:39,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, good luck.</font>

290
00:20:39,860 --> 00:20:42,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's go, Chaozu.</font>

291
00:20:43,580 --> 00:20:45,810
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That bastard!</font>

292
00:20:45,810 --> 00:20:49,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's the world champion for
detestability, that's for sure!</font>

293
00:20:51,170 --> 00:20:58,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Would fighters 99 and 100 in
Block 3 please step into the ring?</font>

294
00:20:58,550 --> 00:20:59,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's my turn.</font>

295
00:20:59,550 --> 00:21:01,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good luck, Ten-<i>san</i>!</font>

296
00:21:01,720 --> 00:21:03,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Check it out, he's up!</font>

297
00:21:03,790 --> 00:21:06,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Guys like him are nothing to worry about.</font>

298
00:21:06,920 --> 00:21:10,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It would be hilarious if
he suddenly lost here!</font>

299
00:21:10,060 --> 00:21:14,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, he's really good!</font>

300
00:21:14,760 --> 00:21:15,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah?</font>

301
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He thinks he's such a big shot!</font>

302
00:21:30,950 --> 00:21:34,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Begin!</font>

303
00:22:04,290 --> 00:22:05,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He passed out!</font>

304
00:22:05,660 --> 00:22:08,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Number 99 wins!</font>

305
00:22:08,460 --> 00:22:10,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We need a stretcher!</font>

306
00:22:10,530 --> 00:22:13,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What in the world happened?!</font>

307
00:22:13,660 --> 00:22:16,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did he do something?</font>

308
00:22:16,470 --> 00:22:18,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Four hand chops...</font>

309
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:21,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Plus two kicks.</font>

310
00:22:21,000 --> 00:22:23,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He's good!</font>

311
00:22:23,670 --> 00:22:26,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But he's not super good!</font>

312
00:22:26,880 --> 00:22:28,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Fools.</i></font>

313
00:22:28,140 --> 00:22:30,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>As if I would show all my</i>
<i>cards during the preliminaries.</i></font>

314
00:22:30,880 --> 00:22:36,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Fighters 27 and 28 in Block 1!</i></font>

315
00:22:36,150 --> 00:22:38,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, that's me!</font>

316
00:22:40,020 --> 00:22:43,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">One, two, three, four...</font>

317
00:22:43,160 --> 00:22:46,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's turn at last...</font>

318
00:22:47,630 --> 00:22:50,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wonder if we'll get to see a lot...</font>

319
00:23:02,730 --> 00:23:04,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's Goku's opponent?</font>

320
00:23:04,960 --> 00:23:07,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He doesn't look that strong...</font>

321
00:23:08,800 --> 00:23:10,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I feel a little bad for the guy,</font>

322
00:23:10,970 --> 00:23:13,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">being paired up with
Goku right off the bat...</font>

323
00:23:18,040 --> 00:23:22,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Look at this. Aren't you
the adorable opponent?</font>

324
00:23:22,710 --> 00:23:26,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm certain I've seen his
face somewhere before...</font>

325
00:23:27,420 --> 00:23:30,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey, isn't that Chapa-o?</font>

326
00:23:30,320 --> 00:23:32,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah...</font>

327
00:23:32,420 --> 00:23:34,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right! He's Chapa-o!</font>

328
00:23:34,860 --> 00:23:38,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Chapa-o? That's Chapa-o?!</font>

329
00:23:38,060 --> 00:23:41,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's run smack into a
really experienced fighter!</font>

330
00:23:41,760 --> 00:23:43,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who's Chapa-o?</font>

331
00:23:43,770 --> 00:23:47,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Basically, he's a really good expert!</font>

332
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:56,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I heard he won a previous
Tenkaichi Budokai...</font>

333
00:23:59,220 --> 00:24:01,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...without anyone ever
laying a finger on him!</font>

334
00:24:03,950 --> 00:24:06,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This could be bad!</font>

335
00:24:06,020 --> 00:24:08,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But this is Goku we're talking about!</font>

336
00:24:08,590 --> 00:24:11,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">He might stand a chance if he's careful!</font>

337
00:24:11,760 --> 00:24:14,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let the match begin!</font>

338
00:24:17,370 --> 00:24:20,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't worry. I won't kill you.</font>

339
00:24:20,740 --> 00:24:22,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you!</font>

340
00:24:26,440 --> 00:24:29,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>This is indeed a tumultuous tournament!</i></font>

341
00:24:29,750 --> 00:24:35,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>What will be the outcome of the</i>
<i>fight between Goku and Chapa-o?!</i></font>

342
00:24:53,190 --> 00:24:56,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

343
00:24:53,190 --> 00:24:56,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

344
00:24:56,060 --> 00:24:58,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Suki sa misuteri</i></font>

345
00:24:56,060 --> 00:24:58,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>I enjoy a mystery</i></font>

346
00:24:58,700 --> 00:25:05,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Kimi no wakasa kakusanai de</i></font>

347
00:24:58,700 --> 00:25:05,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Don't you go hiding your youth!</i></font>

348
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:08,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Fushigi shitakute</i></font>

349
00:25:05,240 --> 00:25:08,270
